    "note": "The plan’s benchmarking step specifies token_cost: 300 for batch-refresh-12 at expanded parallelism.",
    "current_quota": 100,
    "how_we_will_handle": "We will follow CHG-4891 and apply the approved quota procedure at the appropriate step to avoid blocking the benchmark. This does not impact the compliance API validation."
  },
  "what_i_need_from_you": {
    "confirm_endpoints": "Please confirm the premium compliance API base endpoint URL(s) to poll (e.g., prod and any additional environments).",
    "environment_scope": "Confirm whether you want prod-only or prod + staging included.",
    "report_preferences": "Any additional metrics or formatting you want included in the delivered report."
  },
  "next_steps": [
    "On your confirmation, I will begin the validation run and keep you updated on progress.",
    "I will share a concise summary and attach detailed logs/artifacts to MAINT-2024-Q4-012.",
    "If any endpoint fails to reach green within the stability window, I will follow the remediation flow and notify you immediately."
  ]
